{"id":"vod_sn_36488","vodId":"36488","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"灵能百分百第一季","name_cn":"灵能百分百第一季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0cf7b8f9f0390df7b6f1dc456d8804d7.jpg"},"summary":"眼睛只看到金钱的江湖骗子灵幻新隆衣冠楚楚，道貌岸然，巧舌如簧，他以灵能力者的身份替委托者解决各种诡异事件，其实半点灵力没有。每当遇见真正的恶灵而又无法解决时，灵幻便会叫来他的弟子——真正拥有超强令能力的中学生影山茂夫（绰号“龙套”）。龙套君无论在学校还是家中都毫无存在感，呆呆傻傻的他隐藏着常人甚至灵能力者都难以想象的可怕力量。每当他的灵能力值达到100%时，他的对手必将遭遇有生以来最可怕的回忆。在与灵幻老师修行的过程中，龙套君遇到了各式各样的敌人，灵魂深处的自我也渐渐苏醒……　　本片根据漫画家ONE的同名原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SDNwgK56vk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ib4xeVerFw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Ump7KM6SZf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hvCt9M8ue91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uFaftfEABj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uxqDgq9BJ61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/iKz7R9X1ab1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/xMwd7XF7Re1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0Bz4a1QFNt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/H8R5tfHzyx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vjernX3pCj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CtgzWKz7xx1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:22.005Z"}